  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 101.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in subtitle Env-Hw is to implement the provisions of RSA 147-A that require hazardous waste to be managed and disposed properly, so as to minimize risks to the environment and public health and safety.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw100.html"
